  "solution": {
    "text": "$y=4 x^{2}, y=\\frac{x^{2}}{9}, y=2$\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/1II_Cg2ulio41yz_q1rFklkg-BlC4qrI8LxRLMzyBCk.original.fullsize.png\"><br>$A=2 \\int_{0}^{2}\\left(3 \\sqrt{y}-\\frac{\\sqrt{y}}{2}\\right) d y=2 \\int_{0}^{2} \\frac{5 \\sqrt{y}}{2} d y=\\left.5 \\frac{y^{3 / 2}}{3 / 2}\\right|_{0} ^{2}=\\frac{10}{3}\\left[2^{3 / 2}\\right]=\\frac{20 \\sqrt{2}}{3}$",
    "image": null
